#!/usr/bin/env bash
set +e
cat >/tmp/article.html <<'EOF'
<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Practical Social Media Growth Strategy for 2026</title></head><body><main style="max-width:920px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 24px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.82"><h1>Practical Social Media Growth Strategy for 2026</h1><p>Social media growth is most valuable when it supports a clear business objective. Awareness, engagement, website traffic, leads, and sales all require different creative choices and different measurements. A balanced strategy combines useful content, audience research, consistent publishing, profile optimization, analytics, and carefully selected promotional support.</p><p>Businesses researching external providers can include <a href="https://smmfansfaster.com/">SMM Fans Faster</a> in a broader comparison. Useful factors include platform coverage, service descriptions, delivery expectations, support, refill conditions, order limits, and whether the service matches the campaign objective.</p><h2>Build a content system before scaling</h2><p>Content should give people a reason to stop, watch, save, share, comment, or click. Educational posts can answer common questions, demonstrations can show products or services in action, and comparison content can help users make decisions. A repeatable mix of formats is easier to improve than random posting.</p><h2>Use TikTok for rapid creative testing</h2><p>TikTok allows marketers to test hooks, pacing, topics, and video formats quickly. Teams researching additional support can review this guide about <a href="https://smmfansfaster.com/blog/tiktok-followers">TikTok followers</a> and this resource about <a href="https://smmfansfaster.com/blog/tiktok-views">TikTok views, followers, and likes</a>. These numbers should be evaluated together with retention, completion rate, saves, shares, comments, and profile visits.</p><h2>Improve Instagram conversion</h2><p>Instagram combines discovery, education, community, and conversion. Reels can support reach, carousels can explain complex topics, Stories can keep existing followers engaged, and highlights can organize services and proof. Marketers can review this guide to an <a href="https://smmfansfaster.com/blog/instagram-followers-website">Instagram followers website</a> while tracking profile visits, saves, shares, direct messages, and website clicks.</p><h2>Measure the complete funnel</h2><p>Reach and impressions show exposure. Engagement signals show whether content earned attention. Profile visits and clicks show whether viewers moved forward. Leads and purchases show whether the campaign produced business value. A useful dashboard separates these stages so marketers can identify where performance is strong and where improvements are needed.</p><h2>Scale agency workflows carefully</h2><p>Agencies and resellers can review the public <a href="https://smmfansfaster.com/api">SMM API documentation</a> and the <a href="https://smmfansfaster.com/smm-api-integration">SMM API integration</a> resource when comparing automation options. Automation can reduce repetitive work, but target links, quantities, campaign objectives, and reporting should still receive human review.</p><h2>Final approach</h2><p>The strongest long-term social media growth systems connect content quality, audience relevance, promotion, analytics, and conversion. Instead of chasing one visible metric, marketers should improve the entire path from discovery to meaningful action.</p></main></body></html>
EOF
resp=$(curl -sS --max-time 30 -X POST 'https://api.htmlshare.net/v1/publish' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' --data-binary "$(python3 -c 'import json; print(json.dumps({"html":open("/tmp/article.html").read()}))')")
echo "HTMLSHARE_RESPONSE=$resp"
url=$(printf '%s' "$resp" | python3 -c 'import sys,json; print(json.load(sys.stdin).get("url", ""))' 2>/dev/null)
if [[ "$url" == https://htmlshare.net/* ]]; then
 code=$(curl -sS -L -o /tmp/live.html -w '%{http_code}' "$url")
 if [ "$code" = "200" ] && grep -q 'smmfansfaster.com' /tmp/live.html; then echo "RESULT_URL=$url"; else echo "VERIFY_FAILED=$code $url"; fi
fi
